[0.0, "o", "\u001b[1;36m  zfsify  ⚡  Ubuntu → ZFS\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n  \u001b[1;36m[1. Scan disk + choose method]\u001b[0m | 2. Prepare disk | 3. Convert ext4 to ZFS | 4. Finish disk + boot setup\r\n  5. Snapshots + recovery + growth\r\n\r\n  Scan Ubuntu, boot configuration and disk layout\r\n\r\n"]
[0.038, "o", "Detected Ubuntu 24.04 | arm64 | uefi boot\r\nRoot filesystem: /dev/vda1 on /dev/vda | used 70.00% (17418440704 / 24883167232 bytes)\r\n"]
[0.104, "o", "Preserved Ubuntu boot arguments: console=tty1 console=ttyAMA0\r\nCPU/PCI/I/O/display kernel arguments and existing sysctl/modprobe configuration are retained.\r\nActive network links/addresses are captured for the RAM rescue; installed network configuration is preserved.\r\n"]
